.TH QUERENCIA-DATEIEN 1 "October 2026" "querencia-dateien 0.2.1" "Querencia Desktop"
.SH NAME
querencia-dateien \- file manager of Querencia Desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B querencia-dateien
.RI [ GTK-OPTION ...]
.RI [ FOLDER | URI ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B querencia-dateien
(Querencia Dateien, shown as \(lqFiles\(rq in English) is the file manager
of Querencia Desktop, modelled on the browser mode of Nautilus 2.30: menu
bar, toolbar, path bar, side pane \(lqPlaces\(rq with bookmarks, drives and
network places, tabs, icon, list and compact view, thumbnails, a search by
name and a status bar.
.PP
Without arguments it opens a window with the home folder. Each
.I FOLDER
or
.I URI
opens in a window of its own. A running instance takes over new requests
(one GTK application with the ID
.BR org.querencia.Dateien ).
.PP
In the Querencia session it is the default program for folders
.RI ( inode/directory ).
It replaces Querencia Files; the transitional package
.B querencia-files
keeps only its starters, which lead to Querencia Dateien.
.SH OPTIONS
Only the standard options of GTK applications, e.g.
.BR \-\-help .
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+1 / Ctrl+2 / Ctrl+3
icon view / list view / compact view (Querencia Files used Ctrl+1 for its
column view)
.TP
.B Ctrl+T, Ctrl+W
new tab, close tab (the last one closes the window)
.TP
.B Ctrl+Page_Up / Ctrl+Page_Down, Alt+1 ... Alt+0
previous / next tab, tab 1 to 10
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
search by name from the shown folder
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
bookmark the shown folder (Querencia Files: duplicate)
.TP
.B F9
show or hide the side pane (Querencia Files: Ctrl+B)
.TP
.B Ctrl+L
type a location
.TP
.B Ctrl+H
show or hide hidden files
.TP
.B Ctrl+N, Shift+Ctrl+W
new window, close all windows
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/querencia/dateien.ini
settings (dialog Edit \(-> Preferences); written on change
.TP
.I ~/.config/gtk-3.0/bookmarks
bookmarks, shared with GTK file dialogs
.TP
.I ~/.cache/thumbnails
thumbnails (freedesktop cache, shared with other programs); thumbnailers of
other programs run only inside
.BR bwrap (1)
.TP
.I ~/.config/querencia-files/settings.toml
.TQ
.I ~/.config/strata/settings.toml
read once on the first start without
.IR dateien.ini
(the second one only if the first is missing):
six settings of Querencia Files are taken over; the file is never changed
.TP
.I /usr/share/querencia/release
release shown in the About dialog (package querencia-desktop)
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE, LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES, LANG
language of the interface (English, German)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xdg-mime (1),
.BR gio (1),
.BR bwrap (1)
.PP
https://querencialinux.org
